{
  "title": "Oven Roasted Dutch Ground Beef Casserole",
  "description": "A light and flavorful Dutch dish featuring ground beef, oven roasted to perfection in a molcajete vessel, macrobiotic friendly and wood fired baked to a resinous and pillowy texture.",
