  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion to the skillet and cook until softened.",
    "Add the ground beef to the skillet, breaking it up with a spoon as it cooks.",
    "Once the ground beef is browned, add the chopped carrot and potato to the skillet.",
    "Cook the mixture for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Stir in the tomato paste, salt, black pepper, and thyme.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a molcajete vessel.",
    "Top the mixture with chopped parsley.",
    "Bake the casserole in the preheated oven for 30 minutes."
  ],
